---
/**
 * WikiTip — 첫 화면. (wiki-tip.com)
 *
 * ── 2026-08-04 개편 ────────────────────────────────────────────
 * 전에는 **소개문**이었다. 「무엇을 다룰 것이다」만 있고 숫자가 없었다.
 * 사장님 지시로 바꿨다 —
 *   「그릇이 내용물을 결정한다. 첫 화면에 그래픽을 **정적으로, 무겁지 않게**」
 *   「우리의 **유일한 마케팅은 콘텐트를 통한 검색 유입**」
 *
 * 소개문은 검색에 안 걸린다. **숫자와 고유명사가 있어야 걸린다.**
 * 그래서 첫 화면에서 이미 답 하나를 주고, 그 답이 색인되게 한다.
 *
 * ── 왜 이 저장소 안에 있나 ──────────────────────────────────────
 * Cloudtype 구독 총량을 klifemap 과 나눠 쓴다. 매체마다 배포를 띄우면 막힌다.
 * `server.mjs` 가 Host 헤더를 보고 wiki-tip.com 요청을 이 경로로 돌린다.
 * **메모리 추가 0원.** (100yearmap.com 과 같은 방식)
 *
 * ── ⚠ 광고 금지 ────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Riot Production Key 심사 중이다(App 866800). **승인 전에 광고를 달면
 * API 접근이 영구 취소된다.** `WikiTip.astro` 에는 광고 자리를 아예 안 만들었다.
 *
 * ── ⚠ 사진을 쓰지 않는다 ───────────────────────────────────────
 * 소속사 배포 이미지는 **등록 언론사의 보도 이용** 관행이다.
 * 우리는 아직 인터넷신문 등록 전이라 그 자격에 기대지 않는다.
 * 대신 **우리가 만든 숫자를 그림으로** 쓴다 — 저작권이 우리 것이고 아무도 안 갖고 있다.
 *
 * ── 영문이다 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * 사장님 지시: 「모두 영어로 올려야 하는 거 알지? 우리는 영어 사이트야」
 * 1차 독자는 동남아다. 넷플릭스 실측으로도 확인됐다 —
 * 한국 작품 진입 국가 2~9위가 전부 동남아·동아시아였다.
 */
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import WikiTip from '../../layouts/WikiTip.astro';
import charts from '../../data/wikitip-charts.json';
import music from '../../data/wikitip-music-export.json';
import reachData from '../../data/wikitip-reach.json';
import ambiguity from '../../data/wikitip-title-ambiguity.json';
import kpop from '../../data/wikitip-kpop.json';

/*
 * 기사는 컬렉션에서 읽는다. 손으로 적으면 다음 기사 때 문을 안 낸다 —
 * **만들고 링크를 안 걸면 없는 것과 같다.** 최신 3편만 첫 화면에 세운다.
 */
const 기사 = (await getCollection('kcwArticles'))
  .filter((e) => !e.data.draft)
  .sort((a, b) => +new Date(b.data.pubDate) - +new Date(a.data.pubDate))
  .slice(0, 3);
const 날짜 = (v) =>
  new Date(v).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });

const TITLE = 'Korean pop culture, in numbers';
const DESC =
  'Which Korean shows are in the Netflix Top 10 across Southeast Asia this week, and which Korean actors '
  + 'are drawing the most attention on English Wikipedia. Measured, sourced, updated weekly.';

const 백만 = (v) => (v / 1e6).toFixed(0);
const 최대시청 = Math.max(...charts.시청시간.map((r) => r.시간));
const 최대관심 = Math.max(...charts.관심.map((r) => r.합));

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Dataset',
  name: 'Korean titles in the Netflix Top 10 — Southeast Asia',
  description: DESC,
  creator: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'K Culture Wire' },
  temporalCoverage: charts.넷플릭스주,
  isBasedOn: [
    'https://www.netflix.com/tudum/top10',
    'https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/',
    'https://query.wikidata.org/',
  ],
};
---

<WikiTip title={TITLE} description={DESC} jsonLd={jsonLd} canonical="https://www.kculturewire.com/">
  <h1>Korean pop culture, in numbers</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    No rumours, no reprints. We count what Netflix and Wikipedia publish, name every source,
    and say what we left out.
  </p>

  <!--
    ── ⓪ 기사 — 사장님 지시 「네가 할 일은 **영어뉴스**+데이터가공이다」(2026-08-05)
       지면(데이터)만 있고 기사가 0편이던 것을 8/6 에 알고 세웠다. 기사가 맨 위에 온다.
  -->
  {기사.length > 0 && (
    <section class="latest">
      <h2>Latest</h2>
      {기사.map((a) => (
        <article class="teaser">
          <a href={`/article/${a.id}`}>{a.data.title}</a>
          <p class="sub">{a.data.dek}</p>
          <p class="when">{날짜(a.data.pubDate)}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </section>
  )}

  <!-- ── ① 동남아 — K Culture Wire 독자가 사는 곳이다 ───────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>In the Netflix Top 10 across Southeast Asia</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Week of {charts.넷플릭스주} · Singapore, Malaysia, the Philippines, Thailand, Indonesia and Vietnam ·
      Korean-produced titles only
    </p>
    <ol class="rank">
      {charts.동남아.map((r) => (
        <li>
          <span class="bar" style={`--w:${(r.국가수 / 6) * 100}%`}></span>
          <span class="nm">{r.제목}</span>
          <span class="meta">
            <b>{r.국가수}</b> of 6 countries · peaked at <b>#{r.최고순위}</b> · {r.구분}
            {r.이름겹침 && <span class="flag"> · shared title, {r.겹치는나라수} countries</span>}
          </span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p class="note">
      “Korean-produced” comes from Wikidata’s country-of-origin field — not from where it was watched.
      International co-productions that list Korea are counted.
    </p>
    <p class="note">
      <b>“Shared title” means we cannot be sure.</b> We match Netflix’s title text against Wikidata,
      and some titles name a Korean work and a foreign one at once. Where that is true we say so
      rather than drop the row or claim it: the flag marks a title we cannot resolve from text alone,
      not a title we believe is wrong. Across the whole five-year catalogue,{' '}
      <b>{ambiguity.koreaOnly.sharePc}%</b> of the viewing sits on titles only Korean works carry.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/titles">See every Korean title that has charted here since 2021 →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ② 누적 시청시간 ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Most-watched Korean titles, all time</h2>
    <p class="sub">Netflix global weekly hours viewed, summed since July 2021</p>
    <ol class="rank">
      {charts.시청시간.map((r) => (
        <li>
          <span class="bar" style={`--w:${(r.시간 / 최대시청) * 100}%`}></span>
          <span class="nm">{r.제목}</span>
          <span class="meta"><b>{백만(r.시간)}m</b> hours</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p class="note"><a href="/watched">See the full ranking by hours viewed worldwide →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ③ 배우 관심도 ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Korean actors drawing the most attention</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      English Wikipedia page views, {charts.기간} · {charts.잡힘.toLocaleString()} actors measured
    </p>
    <ol class="rank">
      {charts.관심.map((r) => (
        <li>
          <span class="bar" style={`--w:${(r.합 / 최대관심) * 100}%`}></span>
          <span class="nm">{r.이름}</span>
          <span class="meta"><b>{r.합.toLocaleString()}</b> views · {r.작품수} titles</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p class="note"><a href="/actors">See the 50 most looked-up actors →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ④ 상승 — 「핫」은 총량이 아니라 상승이다 ───────────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Rising fastest</h2>
    <p class="sub">Last 7 days against the first 7 of the window · at least 300 views this week</p>
    <ol class="rank">
      {charts.상승.map((r) => (
        <li>
          <span class="nm">{r.이름}</span>
          <span class="meta">×<b>{r.상승배수}</b> · {r.최근7일.toLocaleString()} views this week</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p class="note">
      <b>Attention is not popularity.</b> A page climbs for good news and bad.
      We report the count, not the reason.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑤ 이미 돌고 있는 것 ───────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: the ladder census</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Korea is treated as the reference point for competitive play, but almost nobody measures
      how its player base differs from its neighbours’. We count it daily across six regions.{' '}
      <b>A ladder cannot be measured retroactively</b> — a day not counted is gone.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/esports">See the current census →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑥ 인력 지면 — 엔터·게임 상장사 (2번 지시 0806) ─────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: who works in K-pop and Korean games</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      How long staff stay at Korea’s listed entertainment agencies and game studios, how many
      there are, and the gender split — from company filings. Side by side, not ranked.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/workforce">See the workforce numbers →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑦ 수출 지면 — 20년 시계열 (2번 지시 0806 23:3x 「지면은 남는다」) ── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: where Korean music is sold</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Twenty years of Korean music export value by region, {music.yearFrom}–{music.yearTo}.
      Japan was four-fifths of it in 2012 and is a third now — while Japanese sales kept rising.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/exports">See the twenty-year table →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑧ 방송 수출 지면 — 구조가 뒤집힌 자리 ────────────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: who exports Korean television</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Broadcast programme exports grew 5.4 times since 2012. Terrestrial broadcasters went from
      two-thirds of that trade to 4%; the independent studios went from 7% to half.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/tv-exports">See the thirteen-year table →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑨ 웹툰 지면 — 사장님이 08-04 에 직접 짚으신 축 ────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: Korea’s webtoon businesses, counted</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      All 396 webtoon businesses surveyed in 2024 — by type, by what they do, by headcount and by
      revenue. The average is ₩8.1bn and three-quarters of them earn under ₩1bn.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/webtoon">See the breakdown →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑩ 산업 전체 지면 — 유명한 14곳이 아니라 248곳 ────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: the listed content industry, counted whole</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Not the famous names — all 248 listed Korean companies in broadcasting, film and audio, and
      publishing including games. 68,809 people, against the listed market as a whole.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/industry">See the whole industry →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑪ 지속 vs 강도 — /watched 가 안 쓰던 축 ───────────────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: staying power and force</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      The 50 biggest Korean titles on Netflix, ranked once by how many weeks they lasted and once
      by hours drawn per week. Of the top eight on each measure, only two appear on both.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/staying-power">See both orders →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑫ 층 간격 — /esports 가 GM 을 인원수만 쓰고 있었다 ────── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: how thin is the top of the ladder</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Korea’s top 300 players win only 0.45 points more often than the 700 below them — the
      narrowest gap of six regions, on all four days measured. Elsewhere it is one to two points.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/ladder-gap">See the gap between tiers →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑬ 도달 분포 — /titles 가 목록만 보여 주고 분포는 없었다 ── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: how far Korean titles travel here</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      All {reachData.titleCount} Korean titles that charted in the six Southeast Asian markets, sorted by
      how many of the six they reached. {reachData.buckets[0].share}% reached all six,
      {reachData.buckets[5].share}% reached exactly one, and little sits between.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/reach">See the distribution →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑭ 사다리 교체율 — veteran·hot_streak 를 한 번도 안 썼다 ── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: who stays at the top of the ladder</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Korea has the most settled top tier of six regions — 54% of its challengers are long-standing,
      against 36.8% in North America, which has the most players on hot streaks.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/ladder-churn">See who stays →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑮ 드라마 대 영화 — kind 가 표에 찍히기만 하고 합해진 적이 없었다 ── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: television, not film</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Korea reaches Netflix’s global chart with 151 series and 86 films — and collects 22.3 billion
      hours from the series against 1.5 billion from the films. A quarter of those films go to number
      one, so it is not that they go unnoticed.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/screen-split">See the split →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ⑯ K팝 관심도 — 음악 축에 지면이 /exports 하나뿐이었다 ── -->
  <section>
    <h2>Also running: who the English-speaking world looks up in K-pop</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Every Korean musician and group with an English Wikipedia article —
      {kpop.roster.toLocaleString()} of them — counted over 30 days. Attention, not popularity:
      a page climbs for good news and bad, and we report the count rather than the reason.
    </p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/kpop-attention">See the count →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── 출처 · 제외 — 기사와 같은 기준을 첫 화면에도 건다 ──────── -->
  <section class="src">
    <h2>Where these numbers come from</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Netflix Top 10</b> — the official weekly TSV: 94 countries, 265 weeks since July 2021</li>
      <li><b>Wikidata</b> — country of origin (P495) and cast (P161). Actors are filtered to Korean citizenship (P27)</li>
      <li><b>Wikimedia Pageviews API</b> — English Wikipedia, all access, human traffic only</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="note">
      <b>Not included:</b> other streaming services, which publish no comparable ranking ·
      broadcast ratings · actors with no English Wikipedia article
      ({(charts.대상배우 - charts.잡힘).toLocaleString()} of {charts.대상배우.toLocaleString()} in our roster).
    </p>
    <p class="note">
      Not affiliated with any agency, label or studio. Riot Games does not endorse or sponsor this project.
      Updated {charts.갱신} KST.
    </p>
  </section>
</WikiTip>

<style>
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 5vw, 2.4rem); line-height: 1.25; margin: 1.2rem 0 .8rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 2.5rem; }
  section { margin: 0 0 3rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.12rem; margin: 0 0 .3rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .sub { font-size: .87rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .flag { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }
  .note { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); margin: .9rem 0 0; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* 기사 목록 — 첫 화면 맨 위 */
  .latest .teaser { padding: .9rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .latest .teaser:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .latest .teaser a { font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4;
                      color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .latest .teaser a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .latest .teaser .sub { margin: .35rem 0 0; }
  .latest .when { font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted); margin: .3rem 0 0; }

  /* 순위표 — 칸 배경에 막대를 깐다. 표(정확한 값)와 그래프(크기)를 둘 다 준다 */
  .rank { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; counter-reset: r; }
  .rank li {
    position: relative; counter-increment: r; overflow: hidden;
    padding: .65rem .8rem .65rem 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .rank li::before {
    content: counter(r); position: absolute; left: .4rem; top: .7rem; z-index: 1;
    color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    width: 1.5rem; text-align: right;
  }
  .bar {
    position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: var(--w);
    background: var(--card); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  }
  .nm, .meta { position: relative; }
  .nm { display: block; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; }
  .meta { display: block; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .meta b { color: var(--accent); }

  .src ul { padding-left: 1.1rem; margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; }
  .src li { margin: 0 0 .4rem; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
